{"seq":11,"trial_id":"anatomy-instruction-route-2026-11/hermes-haiku-gbrain-route-tool-mu-v03-dev/sy-02-marrow-agrisupply-sites/r2","wall_ts":"2026-10-30T16:35:46.739Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:10:00-05:00","args_digest":"67c3b49c0d3f59a9078b11cfd5bfe87838dc868c9e5731df981fb13bd82b91ef","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","text":"I found two named sites for Marrow Agrisupply in #central-team, plus some references that aren't clear enough to count.\n\n1. **Eastbank**: Hollis Mbeki, 9 Jun 2026, #central-team. Eastbank receiving-door import on ticket PD-4821. The file labels doors E1/E2 but the booking sheet uses 01/02, so it needs fixing before reimport.\n2. **Pine Crossing**: Priyanka Sundaram, 9 Jun 2026, #central-team. The appointment screen shows only the afternoon shift; Hollis is checking the shift template.\n\nUnclear or not confirmed as Marrow Agrisupply sites:\n- The \"new stores\" rolling out in June are never named in the channel. The store list is in a rollout tracker that isn't in the channel.\n- A Wichita store dispatcher appears in a July 2025 message about a Zoom room. That message doesn't tie him to Marrow Agrisupply.\n- Salina North yard appears in Moss's 2 Jan 2026 handoff digest (teams/team-central/digests/2026-01-02-central-handoffs.md). That digest ties it to \"Pree's dealer account\", not to Marrow Agrisupply by name. It also covers a different account, Marrow Fieldworks, so I left it out.\n- Moss's central cheat sheet has a Marrow Agrisupply entry about \"door 4 msg\", but no site is named.\n\nNothing here is a finance figure. I only read #central-team and the team-central files, so sites mentioned in other channels aren't included. If you want the store list, the rollout tracker or Hollis's ticket updates would be the next places to check."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"DANATOM0001","ts":"1791987000.000124"}}
